 believers and disbelievers] - your Lord will fully compensate them for their deeds. Indeed, He is Aware of what they do.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":111,"sd":null},{"k":"11:112","t":"So remain on a right course as you have been commanded, [you] and those who have turned back with you [to Allāh], and do not transgress. Indeed, He is Seeing of what you do.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":112,"sd":null},{"k":"11:113","t":"And do not incline toward those who do wrong, lest you be touched by the Fire, and you would not have other than Allāh any protectors; then you would not be helped.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":113,"sd":null},{"k":"11:114","t":"And establish prayer at the two ends of the day and at the approach of the night. Indeed, good deeds do away with misdeeds. That is a reminder for those who remember.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":114,"sd":null},{"k":"11:115","t":"And be patient, for indeed, Allāh does not allow to be lost the reward of those who do good.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"11:116","t":"So why were there not among the generations before you those of enduring discrimination forbidding corruption on earth - except a few of those We saved from among them? But those who wronged pursued what luxury they were given therein, and they were criminals.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"11:117","t":"And your Lord would not have destroyed the cities unjustly while their people were reformers.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":117,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":24,"surahs":[11],"sajdah":false}